/// @file CMakeLists.txt
/// @brief Configures the VarBlockSpMM library and benchmark targets.
///
/// Requires a host compiler with C++26 support, CUDA C++23 support, and CUDA
/// Toolkit 13.4 or newer. The project rejects the MSVC/NVCC toolchain.
///
/// @par Source
/// @verbinclude CMakeLists.txt

/// @file build.ps1
/// @brief Runs the WSL based format, configure, documentation, analysis, and build workflow.
///
/// The script accepts configuration, build directory, WSL distribution,
/// micromamba environment, and CUDA architecture parameters. It verifies that
/// compile_commands.json includes the project's CUDA translation unit.
///
/// @par Source
/// @verbinclude build.ps1
